{"id":31599,"imdb":"tt0189974","en":"Lupin the Third: Island of Assassins","orig":"ルパン三世『ワルサーP38』","ar":null,"tag":"Inspector Zenigata has been shot by a Walther P38! The prime suspect? Lupin the Third.","ov":"Lupin is framed for the murder of Inspector Zenigata by a mysterious assailant holding a silver-coloured Walther P38 pistol Lupin himself once owned. Tracking the true killer leads Lupin to the island of the bloodthirsty Tarantula assassins inside the Devil’s Triangle. After joining the spider-tattooed army against their will, Lupin and his gang make both new friends and enemies as they not only plan to take home the Tarantulas’ massive gold repository for themselves, but hunt down the shooter from Lupin’s past. Can Lupin put to rest this demon who haunts his memories with the Walther P38?","rd":"1997-08-01","rt":93,"g":[28,12,16,10770,80,18],"lang":"ja","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Monkey Punch Pictures","logo":null,"c":"JP"},{"n":"Nippon Television Network Corporation","logo":"/bWiM2iY82B32NGmPCOFatgfekIR.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Kyokuichi-Tokyo Movie","logo":null,"c":"JP"}],"countries":["JP"],"langs":["Japanese"],"col":"Lupin the Third Collection","rel":[{"c":"JP","d":"1997-08-01"},{"c":"IT","d":"1999-11-07"},{"c":"AU","d":"2005-04-26"},{"c":"US","d":"2005-04-26"}],"dir":["Hiroyuki Yano"],"prod":["Yasumichi Ozaki","Toshio Nakatani"],"wri":["Shouji Yonemura","Kazuhiko Kato"],"mus":["Yuji Ohno"],"dop":["Motoaki Ikegami"],"cast":[{"n":"Kanichi Kurita","ch":"Arsène Lupin III (voice)","p":"/7XvDPMm6sNspJeZiyfIFBbLRBRI.jpg"},{"n":"Kiyoshi Kobayashi","ch":"Daisuke Jigen (voice)","p":"/xuaKE1xvHHU4gq2bYVlPQ4rEwQV.jpg"},{"n":"Eiko Masuyama","ch":"Fujiko Mine (voice)","p":"/fH9CX5DVv4pyYW7w924hwshKCOC.jpg"},{"n":"Makio Inoue","ch":"Goemon Ishikawa XIII (voice)","p":"/bgKYsgZUPNhbPadTMozuTsTdiGA.jpg"},{"n":"Gorō Naya","ch":"Inspector Koichi Zenigata (voice)","p":"/rFJPhl3lI1kSxHfyMBqVE4XyQSI.jpg"},{"n":"Emi Shinohara","ch":"Ellen (voice)","p":"/ryGauSE9aoEh5D